# Run with the gutter icons in Rider. Register once, then log in, refresh and log out.
# Paste the refreshToken from the login response into @refreshToken.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5067
@refreshToken = paste-from-login-response
# From the verificationUrl in the EmailVerificationRequested message (RabbitMQ UI, queue notification.events)
@userId = paste-user-id
@verifyToken = paste-token

### Register a business and its Owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "Mokoena Plumbing",
  "firstName": "Thabo",
  "lastName": "Mokoena",
  "email": "owner@mokoena.co.za",
  "password": "Demo-Passw0rd!"
}

### Log in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@mokoena.co.za",
  "password": "Demo-Passw0rd!"
}

### Refresh (rotates: the old refresh token stops working)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Log out (revokes the whole session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Verify email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "token": "{{verifyToken}}"
}
